From 09868db913aae95b7aa1bb4a5327642e868e2790 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:06:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] User journey: screens link to the moments they serve, plus
 where they live

A screen now names one or more moments (any stage) and an optional link
(app route or Figma URL). Both fields are optional in JourneyScreenSchema,
so maps saved or exported before this still parse with edits intact.
The bundled screens are linked to their moments; a moment's panel lists
its screens or says "No screen yet"; map cards show a small count; a
deleted moment is unlinked from every screen. Works on staging and
production (not behind journeyTags).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
